{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍和樓單位起火　女住戶不適\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/SMOKE-WTS-261115-2015.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位起火。</p><p>92歲女住戶疑吸入濃煙不適，在地下大堂戴上氧氣罩。傍晚6時許，龍和樓高層一個單位冒煙起火，消防派出一隊煙帽隊，開動一條喉，約20分鐘救熄，約100名居民自行疏散，起火原因有待調查。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T14:22:13.349236+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T12:45:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T16:58:23.216305+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T14:15:52.489909+00:00","content_hash":"6850e57362c17c66255cd46abc3abb132b4e8ac76278b524d471a410fc539b47","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}